WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.000
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:00.000 --> 00:01.000
MkvDrama.net

3
01:38.070 --> 01:43.920
[Small Town Remedy]

4
01:44.220 --> 01:46.890
[Episode 8]

5
01:46.979 --> 01:49.570
[Emergency]

6
02:02.790 --> 02:03.590
Doctor,

7
02:04.040 --> 02:06.000
Between emergency and regular registration,

8
02:06.000 --> 02:07.000
which one is cheaper?

9
02:07.000 --> 02:08.080
They're the same.

10
02:08.080 --> 02:08.910
Just go over there.

11
02:08.910 --> 02:10.630
Register over there. Over there.

12
02:10.630 --> 02:11.750
I don't really have a serious problem.

13
02:11.750 --> 02:12.840
I just dropped something on my foot

14
02:12.840 --> 02:13.810
while working a couple of days ago.

15
02:13.810 --> 02:14.710
Go ahead.

16
02:14.710 --> 02:16.170
Just register over there.

17
02:17.910 --> 02:19.240
Sit here. Let me take a look.

18
02:19.240 --> 02:20.300
Thank you, Doctor.

19
02:21.680 --> 02:22.810
It just got smashed.

20
02:25.630 --> 02:26.690
Take off your sock.

21
02:28.280 --> 02:29.680
How many days has it been?

22
02:29.750 --> 02:31.079
It happened last Saturday.

23
02:30.500 --> 02:32.070
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

24
02:31.079 --> 02:32.840
I-It's been about 5 or 6 days.

25
02:32.579 --> 02:36.910
[Wishing You a Speedy Recovery]

26
02:34.030 --> 02:35.240
It might hurt a bit.

27
02:35.240 --> 02:35.970
Bear with it.

28
02:40.120 --> 02:41.180
The proximal joint

29
02:41.240 --> 02:42.750
of the second toe on your right foot

30
02:42.750 --> 02:44.400
is swollen and deformed.

31
02:45.630 --> 02:47.150
It looks like a localized fracture.

32
02:47.150 --> 02:54.970
[No smoking]

33
02:47.470 --> 02:48.470
You need to have

34
02:48.520 --> 02:50.380
reduction and fixation surgery.

35
02:50.800 --> 02:52.560
Go to the orthopedics department over there

36
02:52.560 --> 02:53.520
and register.

37
02:54.190 --> 02:55.800
Over... over there.

38
02:55.840 --> 02:56.960
Go. Go register.

39
02:58.630 --> 02:59.280
Doctor.

40
03:00.240 --> 03:01.870
I don't have money for surgery.

41
03:01.870 --> 03:03.080
I can put up with the pain.

42
03:03.080 --> 03:04.960
Could you prescribe some painkillers for me?

43
03:04.960 --> 03:06.490
You have to register first.

44
03:06.520 --> 03:07.240
If you don't register,

45
03:07.240 --> 03:08.400
you can't get the medicine.

46
03:08.400 --> 03:09.530
Lie down in the back.

47
03:09.590 --> 03:10.250
Over there.

48
03:10.310 --> 03:11.400
Thank you, Doctor.

49
03:11.590 --> 03:12.190
Thank you.

50
03:15.360 --> 03:16.020
Be careful.

51
03:19.240 --> 03:19.910
Sorry for the trouble.

52
03:19.910 --> 03:22.240
No need to take off your shoes. Just lie down.

53
03:22.240 --> 03:22.900
Don't move.

54
03:37.579 --> 03:40.500
[Emergency Surgery Department]

55
04:10.240 --> 04:11.440
Alright, we're done.

56
04:11.710 --> 04:13.000
Thank you, Doctor.

57
04:12.900 --> 04:17.360
[No smoking]

58
04:14.120 --> 04:15.650
Sit there and wait a moment.

59
04:28.720 --> 04:31.070
Here, these two medicines are for inflammation and pain relief.

60
04:31.070 --> 04:32.400
They're not expensive.

61
04:32.510 --> 04:33.360
Most pharmacies

62
04:33.360 --> 04:34.240
sell them.

63
04:34.830 --> 04:35.830
Buy 1 box of the one on top

64
04:35.830 --> 04:37.000
and 3 boxes of the one on the bottom.

65
04:37.000 --> 04:38.000
Take them according to the instructions.

66
04:38.000 --> 04:38.750
Okay.

67
04:38.800 --> 04:40.070
Thank you, Doctor.

68
04:40.360 --> 04:41.270
It's nothing. Go ahead.

69
04:41.270 --> 04:41.950
Thank you.

70
04:42.270 --> 04:43.240
Thank you.

71
04:48.750 --> 04:51.010
Don't let the president know about this.

72
04:52.310 --> 04:53.000
About what?

73
04:54.040 --> 04:54.830
Nothing.

74
04:56.600 --> 04:58.310
Shall we go to the hospital entrance at noon

75
04:58.310 --> 04:58.830
to grab a bite?

76
04:58.830 --> 04:59.630
My treat.

77
04:59.830 --> 05:01.490
I have something to do at noon.

78
05:02.000 --> 05:02.750
What is it?

79
05:12.120 --> 05:13.720
He definitely wouldn't have

80
05:14.040 --> 05:15.970
broken the rules like this before.

81
05:17.040 --> 05:17.870
And then?

82
05:18.160 --> 05:19.420
Didn't you remind him?

83
05:19.750 --> 05:20.720
I did.

84
05:20.720 --> 05:22.720
Then I changed the subject.

85
05:22.720 --> 05:23.430
I said,

86
05:23.430 --> 05:24.890
"I'll treat you to lunch."

87
05:40.159 --> 05:40.720
Oh no.

88
05:41.630 --> 05:43.560
He comes and goes as he pleases now.

89
05:47.600 --> 05:48.480
How about

90
05:48.720 --> 05:49.980
we go to the president?

91
05:56.830 --> 05:58.750
We're out of options.

92
05:59.070 --> 06:00.600
President, you are wise.

93
06:00.600 --> 06:01.360
You have many ideas.

94
06:01.360 --> 06:02.490
Think of something.

95
06:04.560 --> 06:06.040
Every lock has its key.

96
06:06.870 --> 06:08.160
He has the key.

97
06:09.070 --> 06:10.750
If he doesn't want to open it, there's nothing anyone can do.

98
06:10.750 --> 06:11.600
Then what should we do?

99
06:11.600 --> 06:13.040
Are we just going to leave him alone?

100
06:13.040 --> 06:13.950
The thing is, this guy...

101
06:13.950 --> 06:15.120
He's a really nice guy.

102
06:15.120 --> 06:16.070
If things keep going like this,

103
06:16.070 --> 06:17.000
I'm afraid he won't be able to hold on.

104
06:17.000 --> 06:18.400
Then he can just lie down.

105
06:19.310 --> 06:19.870
Huang,

106
06:19.870 --> 06:21.480
others might not understand this logic,

107
06:21.480 --> 06:22.560
but how could you not?

108
06:22.560 --> 06:24.830
Well, it's fine if I lie down.

109
06:24.830 --> 06:25.920
I'd be quite comfortable lying down.

110
06:25.920 --> 06:27.390
But... he can't.

111
06:27.390 --> 06:28.800
H-He just can't lie down.

112
06:28.920 --> 06:30.180
Then what should we do?

113
06:31.310 --> 06:33.170
Think of a way to make him lie down?

114
06:33.720 --> 06:34.680
Can you think of one?

115
06:34.680 --> 06:35.510
How could I?

116
06:35.510 --> 06:36.750
I can't...

117
06:36.750 --> 06:37.240
I can't think of anything.

118
06:37.240 --> 06:38.430
Can you?

119
06:40.040 --> 06:42.370
Then what are you two worrying about here?

120
06:45.120 --> 06:46.380
Lie down if you need to.

121
06:46.680 --> 06:48.140
And stand up if you need to.

122
06:48.390 --> 06:49.390
I'll just eat when I need to.

123
06:49.390 --> 06:50.590
Do you guys want some?

124
07:10.870 --> 07:11.680
She was crying

125
07:12.000 --> 07:14.530
when she got discharged early in the morning.

126
08:21.500 --> 08:26.250
[Ai Chen]

127
08:22.120 --> 08:24.070
Pick a photo of Aunt Ling

128
08:24.360 --> 08:26.560
and send it to me before tomorrow night.

129
09:34.850 --> 09:38.760
[Remembered for All Time]

130
09:45.270 --> 09:46.320
Look.

131
09:46.790 --> 09:48.320
I know it's not easy for you,

132
09:48.320 --> 09:49.450
a widow with a child.

133
09:50.150 --> 09:51.120
This package...

134
09:51.440 --> 09:54.170
including transportation, ceremony, storage,

135
09:54.320 --> 09:55.120
urn,

136
09:55.600 --> 09:57.440
burial, funeral,

137
09:57.440 --> 09:58.840
wreaths, and condolence couplets,

138
09:58.840 --> 10:00.240
is only 150 yuan in total.

139
10:00.600 --> 10:01.600
I'm really not making any money off this.

140
10:01.600 --> 10:03.000
It's not about the money.

141
10:03.150 --> 10:04.870
As long as he can be cremated and buried, that's fine.

142
10:04.870 --> 10:06.530
Keep everything else simple.

143
10:06.670 --> 10:07.480
Ling.

144
10:07.750 --> 10:09.080
Don't keep it simple.

145
10:09.080 --> 10:10.080
I'll pay for it.

146
10:11.320 --> 10:13.080
We've discussed it,

147
10:14.080 --> 10:15.880
and we're willing to cover half.

148
10:16.630 --> 10:17.890
I don't need your help.

149
10:18.480 --> 10:20.240
I said it's not about the money.

150
10:21.200 --> 10:22.120
The most important thing for me right now

151
10:22.120 --> 10:22.870
is to give birth

152
10:22.870 --> 10:24.070
to this child safely.

153
10:28.080 --> 10:29.480
When Liu was alive,

154
10:29.480 --> 10:30.670
we discussed it.

155
10:32.000 --> 10:33.400
No matter who dies first,

156
10:34.360 --> 10:35.690
we won't have a funeral.

157
10:36.120 --> 10:39.030
Having each other in our hearts is better than anything.

158
10:39.030 --> 10:40.390
I'm Liu's wife.

159
10:40.440 --> 10:41.630
I have the final say.

160
10:44.080 --> 10:45.480
There will be no funeral.

161
11:21.630 --> 11:22.840
You never surprise me

162
11:22.840 --> 11:24.240
but always scare me, huh?

163
11:26.320 --> 11:28.180
But it's good that you moved back.

164
11:32.630 --> 11:34.000
You look fine to me,

165
11:36.510 --> 11:38.200
but you're not really fine.

166
11:39.240 --> 11:40.900
You need to eat and sleep well.

167
11:42.000 --> 11:43.320
You've been bottling up too many emotions.

168
11:43.320 --> 11:45.380
You have to find a way to release them.

169
11:45.390 --> 11:47.390
Although it's hard to think of a way,

170
11:47.720 --> 11:49.030
I'm sure you can figure it out.

171
11:49.030 --> 11:51.560
Otherwise, you'll hurt yourself and others.

172
12:05.270 --> 12:06.270
We don't need him.

173
12:07.200 --> 12:08.660
He doesn't need to attend.

174
12:08.750 --> 12:09.750
Why are you going?

175
12:10.120 --> 12:11.780
What's the point of you going?

176
12:12.120 --> 12:13.120
Up until now,

177
12:13.120 --> 12:14.720
he hasn't shed a single tear.

178
12:14.750 --> 12:15.510
In his heart,

179
12:15.840 --> 12:16.510
he's cold-blooded

180
12:16.510 --> 12:17.440
to the bone!

181
12:18.240 --> 12:19.100
Cold-blooded!

182
12:35.870 --> 12:36.750
I thought about quitting.

183
12:36.750 --> 12:37.550
I couldn't play anymore.

184
12:37.550 --> 12:38.550
In the last round,

185
12:38.630 --> 12:39.510
I was waiting for a Baozhongbao.

186
12:39.510 --> 12:40.440
Darn it!

187
12:42.630 --> 12:43.490
What happened?

188
12:46.320 --> 12:47.360
And then?

189
12:47.390 --> 12:49.080
I was so excited.

190
12:49.150 --> 12:50.440
If I won with a Baozhongbao,

191
12:50.440 --> 12:51.720
wouldn't I win back everything

192
12:51.720 --> 12:53.270
I lost that night?

193
12:53.480 --> 12:54.600
I thought to myself at the time,

194
12:54.600 --> 12:57.360
even if someone else discarded the tile I needed, I wouldn't take it.

195
12:57.360 --> 12:58.560
I wanted to draw it myself.

196
12:58.560 --> 13:03.320
[Liu Zhengliang]

197
12:58.840 --> 13:00.030
It means a bigger win, right?

198
13:00.030 --> 13:00.750
So I kept drawing.

199
13:00.750 --> 13:02.120
One tile

200
13:02.120 --> 13:02.670
after another.

201
13:02.670 --> 13:04.240
I was thinking, if there were only 4 tiles left,

202
13:04.240 --> 13:05.790
wouldn't the game be a draw?

203
13:05.790 --> 13:06.510
Right.

204
13:06.550 --> 13:08.320
Then all the time I spent forging Baozhongbao

205
13:08.320 --> 13:09.600
would... be for nothing.

206
13:09.600 --> 13:10.320
Right.

207
13:10.360 --> 13:12.290
There was just one left, so I was...

208
13:20.750 --> 13:21.480
He...

209
13:38.840 --> 13:39.770
Hello everyone.

210
13:39.840 --> 13:40.770
I'm Chen Junnan,

211
13:40.790 --> 13:42.650
transferred from No. 1 Hospital.

212
13:43.600 --> 13:44.360
From now on, I'll be

213
13:44.360 --> 13:45.560
working with you all.

214
13:45.600 --> 13:46.600
Welcome.

215
13:47.030 --> 13:49.290
I brought some small gifts for everyone.

216
13:50.720 --> 13:51.360
Bro.

217
13:51.790 --> 13:52.440
Bro.

218
13:52.440 --> 13:53.510
Don't stand on the ceremony.

219
13:53.510 --> 13:54.770
Open it and take a look.

220
13:58.150 --> 13:59.120
Is it wild?

221
13:59.480 --> 14:00.550
Yes, purely wild.

222
14:06.120 --> 14:07.510
This stuff is hard to get.

223
14:07.510 --> 14:08.360
It's not easy to find.

224
14:08.360 --> 14:09.270
Bro,

225
14:09.270 --> 14:10.510
you are too generous.

226
14:14.630 --> 14:15.440
Studying?

227
14:19.150 --> 14:19.880
It's for you.

228
14:20.600 --> 14:24.030
It's full of study materials by famous teachers.

229
14:24.630 --> 14:25.830
I bought them online.

230
14:25.840 --> 14:26.550
Thank you.

231
14:26.670 --> 14:27.600
You're welcome.

232
14:30.600 --> 14:31.730
If you don't like it,

233
14:32.270 --> 14:34.070
that's fine. Drink some of this.

234
14:36.510 --> 14:38.000
It promotes digestion

235
14:38.240 --> 14:39.440
and boosts immunity.

236
14:39.750 --> 14:42.150
When you're tired of studying, drink this.

237
14:42.320 --> 14:43.270
Collagen.

238
14:43.270 --> 14:44.240
Okay, just put them here.

239
14:44.240 --> 14:44.870
Thank you.

240
14:48.480 --> 14:49.200
Come here, bro.

241
14:49.200 --> 14:49.750
Come and sit.

242
14:49.750 --> 14:50.200
Bro.

243
14:51.150 --> 14:51.910
After work,

244
14:51.910 --> 14:52.910
if you have time,

245
14:53.240 --> 14:54.700
we can have a little drink.

246
14:55.270 --> 14:56.080
You can drink?

247
14:56.550 --> 14:57.600
My tolerance is low.

248
14:57.600 --> 14:58.840
I just like having a drink.

249
14:58.840 --> 14:59.750
Okay. Alright.

250
14:59.750 --> 15:00.840
Okay.

251
15:01.080 --> 15:02.340
Is this your recliner?

252
15:02.670 --> 15:03.360
Yes.

253
15:03.360 --> 15:04.270
Can I try it?

254
15:04.270 --> 15:05.150
Go ahead.

255
15:09.080 --> 15:10.280
Careful. Don't fall.

256
15:10.600 --> 15:11.840
Bro, come.

257
15:12.080 --> 15:12.670
I'll show you...

258
15:12.670 --> 15:13.870
I'll show you around.

259
15:14.270 --> 15:15.790
Come on, let's go.

260
15:18.030 --> 15:18.840
Mingming,

261
15:18.910 --> 15:20.310
keep an eye on my lingzhi.

262
15:22.150 --> 15:23.000
Open it and take a look.

263
15:23.000 --> 15:23.510
Okay.

264
15:24.550 --> 15:25.870
Our hospital is just a bit small.

265
15:25.870 --> 15:27.120
Everything else is pretty much the same

266
15:27.120 --> 15:27.960
as your No. 1 Hospital.

267
15:27.960 --> 15:28.360
Yes.

268
15:28.360 --> 15:28.720
Look.

269
15:29.030 --> 15:30.840
Ultrasound room, wound dressing room.

270
15:30.840 --> 15:32.770
This is the medical staff passage.

271
15:33.000 --> 15:33.790
Zhengliang!

272
15:34.550 --> 15:35.550
I'm here!

273
15:38.790 --> 15:39.920
What does that mean?

274
15:40.240 --> 15:41.500
It means what it means.

275
15:41.720 --> 15:43.580
I don't know what it means either.

276
16:02.790 --> 16:04.650
When you were in a bad mood as a kid,

277
16:04.720 --> 16:07.080
we always went to the shop by the old tower to buy candy.

278
16:07.080 --> 16:08.270
Ma'am, I want this.

279
16:08.510 --> 16:10.910
-Okay. I'll get it for you. -I'll take this.

280
16:13.600 --> 16:14.400
Twenty cents.

281
16:19.360 --> 16:19.670
Here.

282
16:19.670 --> 16:20.960
Okay, exact change.

283
16:26.030 --> 16:26.840
Let's go.

284
16:33.510 --> 16:35.640
I remember back in elementary school,

285
16:36.720 --> 16:37.600
Aunt Ling was planning

286
16:37.600 --> 16:39.000
to send you to Guangzhou.

287
16:40.240 --> 16:42.040
You were unhappy for a long time,

288
16:42.200 --> 16:43.960
sulking and not speaking.

289
16:47.360 --> 16:48.510
Do you remember

290
16:48.510 --> 16:50.640
what your first words were after that?

291
16:58.320 --> 17:01.120
You don't have to say anything if you don't want to.

292
17:19.880 --> 17:21.810
Actually, I feel terrible inside.

293
17:24.920 --> 17:26.980
But I don't know what's wrong with me.

294
17:28.069 --> 17:30.110
Why can't I just cry?

295
17:37.110 --> 17:38.200
I heard that

296
17:38.720 --> 17:40.450
when people are extremely sad,

297
17:42.830 --> 17:44.270
they just can't cry.

298
17:46.000 --> 17:46.680
Wanting to cry but being unable to—

299
17:46.680 --> 17:48.410
that's probably what it means.

300
17:51.270 --> 17:52.270
Actually, my mom didn't hold a funeral

301
17:52.270 --> 17:53.960
for my dad back then.

302
17:56.110 --> 17:57.200
And I never saw her

303
17:57.200 --> 17:58.680
shed a single tear.

304
18:01.790 --> 18:03.200
And she always told me...

305
18:04.720 --> 18:05.920
that...

306
18:07.200 --> 18:08.860
keeping someone in your heart

307
18:08.920 --> 18:10.320
is better than anything.

308
18:16.030 --> 18:17.350
When Aunt Ling cried,

309
18:17.350 --> 18:18.640
you just didn't see it.

310
18:30.550 --> 18:31.550
Do you have any way

311
18:31.680 --> 18:32.960
to make me cry?

312
18:33.510 --> 18:35.750
Tear glands and sweat glands are exocrine glands.

313
18:35.750 --> 18:37.000
You know this, right?

314
18:37.160 --> 18:39.110
Letting tears turn into sweat

315
18:39.160 --> 18:40.790
and flow out is also good.

316
19:05.640 --> 19:06.440
Dr. Liu,

317
19:06.830 --> 19:07.790
take a break

318
19:07.790 --> 19:08.920
and have some water.

319
19:13.880 --> 19:14.830
Can you stop

320
19:14.830 --> 19:16.430
and listen to me for a second?

321
19:19.200 --> 19:20.000
How about...

322
19:20.070 --> 19:20.750
you go home early tonight

323
19:20.750 --> 19:22.070
and get some sleep?

324
19:22.160 --> 19:23.960
There's no rush for the PhD exam.

325
19:26.400 --> 19:27.720
I knew it all along.

326
19:28.790 --> 19:29.790
Knew what?

327
19:30.510 --> 19:31.310
You don't really

328
19:31.310 --> 19:32.710
want to take the PhD exam.

329
19:34.790 --> 19:35.590
What?

330
19:37.920 --> 19:38.720
I said,

331
19:39.400 --> 19:41.790
you're not putting your heart into it at all.

332
19:41.790 --> 19:44.650
You are sleepy during the day and slack off at night.

333
19:44.750 --> 19:46.110
But I can understand.

334
19:46.550 --> 19:48.510
Staying in a place like this for too long,

335
19:48.510 --> 19:49.510
you naturally

336
19:49.550 --> 19:50.960
get lazier.

337
19:51.720 --> 19:52.350
I saw that you

338
19:52.350 --> 19:54.110
haven't rested well these two days.

339
19:54.110 --> 19:54.790
So I figured I'd let you

340
19:54.790 --> 19:55.830
go home early to rest.

341
19:55.830 --> 19:57.160
What are you talking about?

342
19:57.160 --> 19:58.550
I'm telling the truth.

343
20:05.160 --> 20:05.750
Do you really have to

344
20:05.750 --> 20:07.010
look down on everyone?

345
20:07.070 --> 20:08.730
even when they treat you well?

346
20:10.480 --> 20:11.200
What's wrong with them?

347
20:11.200 --> 20:12.200
That's why I don't want to lie to you.

348
20:12.200 --> 20:13.400
Aren't they arguing?

349
20:15.590 --> 20:16.880
Why are you so nosy?

350
20:16.880 --> 20:18.440
-I just want to take a look. -Let's go.

351
20:18.440 --> 20:19.510
In your current state,

352
20:19.510 --> 20:21.790
staying in a place like this,

353
20:22.350 --> 20:23.680
you won't pass the exam.

354
20:23.720 --> 20:24.270
Yes.

355
20:25.160 --> 20:26.480
I fell into the mud.

356
20:26.550 --> 20:28.150
Am I not allowed to climb out?

357
20:28.790 --> 20:30.240
Besides, no matter how bad Xiaoximen Hospital is,

358
20:30.240 --> 20:30.920
is it up to a fired doctor

359
20:30.920 --> 20:32.650
like you to pass judgment on it?

360
20:51.200 --> 20:51.790
Let me tell you,

361
20:51.790 --> 20:53.270
don't be so nosy all day.

362
20:53.270 --> 20:54.590
What does it have to do with you?

363
20:54.590 --> 20:56.030
I didn't say anything.

364
20:56.830 --> 20:57.640
You're here?

365
20:57.640 --> 20:58.440
Who are you?

366
21:00.480 --> 21:02.160
He... he took the ball!

367
21:04.960 --> 21:06.350
Thief! Thief!

368
21:06.350 --> 21:07.000
Stop him!

369
21:07.200 --> 21:08.200
Stop right there!

370
21:11.160 --> 21:12.160
Stop right there!

371
21:13.940 --> 21:17.630
[Accessible Route]

372
21:15.200 --> 21:16.440
Don't move! What did you take?

373
21:16.440 --> 21:17.100
Let go of me!

374
21:18.310 --> 21:19.400
I saw it! Honey!

375
21:19.400 --> 21:19.960
Here comes another one!

376
21:19.960 --> 21:20.640
Here!

377
21:20.720 --> 21:21.960
Pry his hands open! Pry his hands open!

378
21:21.960 --> 21:22.480
Listen to me!

379
21:22.480 --> 21:23.440
Pry his hands open!

380
21:23.440 --> 21:24.110
Give it to me!

381
21:24.110 --> 21:25.170
Pry his hands open!

382
21:25.720 --> 21:26.480
Take it! Take it!

383
21:26.480 --> 21:27.200
Give it back to me!

384
21:27.200 --> 21:27.720
It's mine!

385
21:27.720 --> 21:28.200
Give it to me!

386
21:28.200 --> 21:28.800
It's mine!

387
21:29.400 --> 21:30.000
What?

388
21:30.960 --> 21:32.000
What are you doing?

389
21:32.000 --> 21:32.680
Doctor!

390
21:32.250 --> 21:36.560
[Accessible Route]

391
21:32.830 --> 21:33.790
Call the police, Doctor!

392
21:33.790 --> 21:34.440
What's going on?

393
21:34.440 --> 21:35.310
There's a thief!

394
21:35.310 --> 21:35.920
Wait a minute.

395
21:35.920 --> 21:36.790
No, no, no!

396
21:36.790 --> 21:38.440
-No! Don't call the police! -You stole our stuff!

397
21:38.440 --> 21:39.770
Now you're scared, huh?

398
21:41.160 --> 21:41.960
Comrade.

399
21:42.310 --> 21:43.570
You hit me pretty hard.

400
21:43.920 --> 21:44.960
This shows

401
21:45.550 --> 21:47.550
your loyalty to the revolution.

402
21:47.960 --> 21:48.750
Comrade!

403
21:49.440 --> 21:50.700
We are on the same side.

404
21:51.110 --> 21:52.510
You don't know anything.

405
21:52.510 --> 21:53.570
What should I know?

406
21:53.680 --> 21:54.680
This contains

407
21:54.920 --> 21:56.000
important intelligence

408
21:56.000 --> 21:57.240
related to national security!

409
21:57.240 --> 21:59.270
I need to take it to Beijing

410
21:59.310 --> 22:00.830
and hand it to my chief personally,

411
22:00.830 --> 22:01.480
Zhang...

412
22:02.400 --> 22:03.350
I can't tell you

413
22:03.350 --> 22:04.270
who my chief is.

414
22:04.400 --> 22:05.750
Dawn is just around the corner!

415
22:05.750 --> 22:07.080
Just around the corner!

416
22:07.880 --> 22:10.140
I studied medicine because of my family.

417
22:10.680 --> 22:12.080
I was young and ignorant.

418
22:12.750 --> 22:15.310
I thought being a doctor would make me a lot of money.

419
22:15.310 --> 22:17.640
I didn't expect that it would take 8 years just to graduate.

420
22:17.640 --> 22:19.030
Even so, after graduation,

421
22:19.030 --> 22:19.550
I had no choice

422
22:19.550 --> 22:20.920
but to work here.

423
22:21.350 --> 22:23.150
Do you think it was my own choice?

424
22:23.750 --> 22:25.680
The base salary is just over 3,000.

425
22:26.200 --> 22:27.200
Adding everything up,

426
22:27.200 --> 22:28.130
it's only 5,000.

427
22:28.350 --> 22:29.480
What can I do with it?

428
22:30.110 --> 22:31.680
Even so, many patients still think

429
22:31.680 --> 22:32.790
that we are to blame for the difficulty

430
22:32.790 --> 22:34.440
and high cost of seeing a doctor.

431
22:34.440 --> 22:35.590
What can I do?

432
22:35.880 --> 22:37.680
The overall environment is just like this.

433
22:37.680 --> 22:38.510
And I don't have your luck.

434
22:38.510 --> 22:39.640
I can't get out.

435
22:41.720 --> 22:43.320
I just want to rely on myself.

436
22:44.240 --> 22:45.030
I'm improving myself,

437
22:45.030 --> 22:45.750
applying for a PhD,

438
22:45.750 --> 22:47.240
and taking professional title exams,

439
22:47.240 --> 22:48.550
so that I can make more money

440
22:48.550 --> 22:49.240
and improve

441
22:49.240 --> 22:50.030
my family's quality of life.

442
22:50.030 --> 22:51.960
Is there anything wrong with that?

443
22:54.030 --> 22:55.400
There's nothing wrong with that.

444
22:55.400 --> 22:56.110
Don't get worked up.

445
22:56.110 --> 22:57.110
I'm not worked up.

446
22:57.310 --> 22:58.680
Why would I be worked up?

447
23:00.680 --> 23:02.350
You... You said I'm sleepy during the day

448
23:02.350 --> 23:03.480
and slack off at night.

449
23:03.480 --> 23:04.200
That's because...

450
23:04.200 --> 23:04.880
Mingming!

451
23:04.880 --> 23:05.640
What?

452
23:05.940 --> 23:09.160
[Xiaoximen Hospital]

453
23:06.110 --> 23:07.440
Your... your dad's...

454
23:13.590 --> 23:15.030
He usually forgets about it afterwards.

455
23:15.030 --> 23:16.830
I didn't expect him to remember it this time.

456
23:16.830 --> 23:17.830
I'm really sorry

457
23:17.830 --> 23:19.030
for causing you trouble.

458
23:19.030 --> 23:20.640
I'll definitely keep an eye on him from now on.

459
23:20.640 --> 23:21.440
It's fine.

460
23:21.480 --> 23:22.830
Well, if you need anything, just let me know.

461
23:22.830 --> 23:24.030
I'll head back first.

462
23:25.750 --> 23:26.400
Stop looking!

463
23:26.400 --> 23:27.110
Move along! Move along!

464
23:27.110 --> 23:27.750
There's nothing to see.

465
23:27.750 --> 23:28.310
Go now.

466
23:28.310 --> 23:29.310
Mingming really

467
23:29.680 --> 23:30.590
has it tough.

468
23:33.400 --> 23:34.110
That guy just now

469
23:34.110 --> 23:35.160
was Mingming's father.

470
23:35.160 --> 23:36.560
His name is Che Changhai.

471
23:36.960 --> 23:38.960
He has moderate schizophrenia,

472
23:39.270 --> 23:40.110
the kind that no matter how you treat it,

473
23:40.110 --> 23:41.310
it can't be cured.

474
23:42.590 --> 23:44.680
He... He firmly believes

475
23:44.680 --> 23:45.680
that he is

476
23:45.830 --> 23:47.310
here to protect national security

477
23:47.310 --> 23:49.970
and is an undercover agent for an organization.

478
23:59.270 --> 24:00.200
Comrade Xiaobo.

479
24:02.110 --> 24:04.510
I've encountered many difficulties here.

480
24:04.830 --> 24:06.030
Please continue.

481
24:06.160 --> 24:06.960
He said

482
24:06.960 --> 24:09.510
that after completing his mission,

483
24:09.510 --> 24:10.880
he would return to Beijing

484
24:10.880 --> 24:12.350
and go to a secret base

485
24:12.510 --> 24:13.480
to work.

486
24:13.790 --> 24:14.750
Could what he said

487
24:14.750 --> 24:16.230
be true?

488
24:19.000 --> 24:20.310
Mingming, this girl,

489
24:20.310 --> 24:21.070
is a

490
24:21.070 --> 24:22.400
very proud person.

491
24:23.000 --> 24:24.350
When she was in elementary school,

492
24:24.350 --> 24:25.510
her dad got sick.

493
24:26.240 --> 24:27.160
Then, he kept

494
24:27.160 --> 24:28.360
causing her trouble.

495
24:28.750 --> 24:30.160
You see, from her college years

496
24:30.160 --> 24:31.270
to her working life,

497
24:31.270 --> 24:32.790
her dad has always been

498
24:33.310 --> 24:34.590
a burden on her

499
24:35.270 --> 24:36.400
in her daily life.

500
24:37.310 --> 24:38.910
That's really tough for her.

501
24:39.510 --> 24:41.200
Sometimes I think

502
24:41.270 --> 24:42.640
she and Zhang Hao got a divorce

503
24:42.640 --> 24:44.030
because of

504
24:44.030 --> 24:45.030
her family situation.

505
24:45.030 --> 24:46.440
She was married?

506
24:47.270 --> 24:48.440
Who is Zhang Hao?

507
24:49.400 --> 24:51.200
He's the guy sitting over there.

508
24:59.260 --> 25:00.260
[No Unauthorized Entry into Doctors' Lounge]

509
25:08.160 --> 25:09.790
I wasn't finished speaking earlier.

510
25:09.790 --> 25:11.110
Didn't you say I'm sleepy during the day

511
25:11.110 --> 25:12.000
and slack off at night,

512
25:12.000 --> 25:13.830
and that I don't really want to take the PhD exam?

513
25:13.830 --> 25:15.350
If you have time, come with me.

514
25:15.350 --> 25:16.070
I'll take you to see

515
25:16.070 --> 25:17.400
where I work part-time.

516
25:19.000 --> 25:19.920
Can I go?

517
25:22.160 --> 25:23.160
Bring me along.

518
25:46.000 --> 25:46.720
Hello?

519
25:48.160 --> 25:49.820
Do you have a solo photo of Mom?

520
25:53.720 --> 25:54.510
No.

521
25:58.750 --> 25:59.790
Right, I don't even have one.

522
25:59.790 --> 26:00.680
How could you?

523
26:02.110 --> 26:03.440
I shouldn't have asked.

524
26:15.270 --> 26:16.070
What's wrong?

525
26:20.880 --> 26:21.680
We're here.

526
26:22.000 --> 26:26.890
[Fucheng Transport Company]

527
26:27.940 --> 26:33.120
[Fucheng City Taxi]

528
26:47.390 --> 26:52.410
[Little Pepper Stage: Blossoming Passion]

529
26:52.540 --> 26:58.140
[Little Pepper Stage]

530
27:00.200 --> 27:01.000
I really didn't expect

531
27:01.000 --> 27:03.240
the theater for the sing-and-dance duet

532
27:03.240 --> 27:04.110
to be like this now.

533
27:04.110 --> 27:07.160
It's my first time watching a sing-and-dance duet here.

534
27:07.160 --> 27:08.310
How is that possible?

535
27:08.310 --> 27:09.960
You've lived in the Northeast for so many years.

536
27:09.960 --> 27:10.440
No.

537
27:10.790 --> 27:11.960
I've seen sing-and-dance duets before,

538
27:11.960 --> 27:13.480
but this is my first time seeing one in a theater.

539
27:13.480 --> 27:14.510
I used to think

540
27:14.510 --> 27:15.480
that the people who came to the theater

541
27:15.480 --> 27:16.920
were all elders.

542
27:17.240 --> 27:18.480
I just realized after coming here

543
27:18.480 --> 27:20.480
that there are so many young people.

544
27:33.160 --> 27:34.270
Listen up, you two.

545
27:34.350 --> 27:35.750
You two will open the show today

546
27:35.750 --> 27:38.680
and sing the new version of "Widow Ma Running a Shop."

547
27:39.070 --> 27:39.750
Mr. Wang.

548
27:40.160 --> 27:41.490
Mr. Wang, wait a minute.

549
27:42.880 --> 27:44.750
Didn't I just tell you?

550
27:44.750 --> 27:46.350
I have two colleagues here today.

551
27:46.350 --> 27:47.440
I don't want to sing dirty songs.

552
27:47.440 --> 27:49.270
Come on. You sing clean songs every day,

553
27:49.270 --> 27:50.160
and that has driven away several

554
27:50.160 --> 27:50.790
of my regular customers.

555
27:50.790 --> 27:51.960
Don't you know that?

556
27:52.160 --> 27:52.920
If you don't sing,

557
27:52.920 --> 27:54.000
get out of here today.

558
27:54.000 --> 27:55.530
Don't be a dog in the manger!

559
27:55.720 --> 27:56.830
You two, sing dirty songs.

560
27:56.830 --> 27:57.920
You all have to sing dirty songs today!

561
27:57.920 --> 27:58.270
Okay.

562
27:58.270 --> 27:58.680
Okay.

563
28:10.440 --> 28:13.310
Sis, you can't do anything about Manager Wang.

564
28:14.030 --> 28:15.440
We're just trying to make a living.

565
28:15.440 --> 28:17.570
There's no shame in singing anything.

566
28:20.510 --> 28:21.370
Little Jujube.

567
28:22.750 --> 28:24.750
We've been partners for half a year.

568
28:24.920 --> 28:26.400
You know my temper.

569
28:27.960 --> 28:29.690
I can't get along with that guy.

570
28:32.750 --> 28:33.960
Today might be my last time

571
28:33.960 --> 28:35.160
performing here.

572
28:35.750 --> 28:37.030
Can you do me a favor?

573
28:39.000 --> 28:39.790
Sure.

574
28:40.240 --> 28:41.480
I've always found that guy Wang

575
28:41.480 --> 28:42.400
annoying.

576
28:42.640 --> 28:43.750
I'll help you beat him up.

577
28:43.750 --> 28:45.410
Wait here. I'll go find a sack.

578
28:45.830 --> 28:47.110
That's not what I meant.

579
28:47.110 --> 28:48.310
Then what do you mean?

580
29:03.720 --> 29:06.400
Bravo! Bravo! Bravo!

581
29:04.450 --> 29:07.590
[Little Pepper Stage]

582
29:09.920 --> 29:10.960
Not bad. Not bad.

583
29:14.790 --> 29:16.510
Thank you all

584
29:16.510 --> 29:19.070
for coming to Little Pepper Stage.

585
29:19.240 --> 29:21.110
I'm your host, Wang Tiezhu.

586
29:21.160 --> 29:22.640
I'm your host, Lin Lin.

587
29:22.960 --> 29:24.480
You're all regular customers,

588
29:24.480 --> 29:25.810
so without further ado,

589
29:26.200 --> 29:28.310
let's welcome our most fabulous duo,

590
29:28.350 --> 29:29.270
Little Jujube!

591
29:29.270 --> 29:30.350
And Big Pomegranate,

592
29:30.350 --> 29:32.510
to bring you the opening performance,

593
29:32.510 --> 29:34.590
"Widow Ma Running a Shop!"

594
29:34.590 --> 29:37.120
Please welcome them with a round of applause!

595
29:48.640 --> 29:50.270
My dear folks,

596
29:50.270 --> 29:52.310
good evening!

597
29:52.480 --> 29:53.270
Bravo!

598
29:53.350 --> 29:56.510
Bravo! Bravo!

599
29:56.750 --> 29:58.590
I am Big Pomegranate!

600
29:56.980 --> 30:00.340
[Widow Ma Running a Shop]

601
29:58.590 --> 30:01.070
I am your favorite Little Jujube!

602
30:02.110 --> 30:03.910
The applause isn't loud enough.

603
30:05.640 --> 30:07.350
Thank you all for coming.

604
30:11.780 --> 30:21.650
[Widow Ma Running a Shop] [Big Pomegranate & Little Jujube]

605
30:13.310 --> 30:17.550
♪ I fall to my knees and kowtow ♪

606
30:17.550 --> 30:20.960
♪ Tears streaming down my face ♪

607
30:19.680 --> 30:21.480
Shouldn't this be about a widow?

608
30:22.200 --> 30:23.110
♪ Zhonghua ♪

609
30:23.110 --> 30:24.960
♪ Godmother ♪

610
30:24.960 --> 30:26.960
An empress dowager is also a widow.

611
30:27.070 --> 30:27.920
Is that so?

612
30:28.160 --> 30:29.640
I think they made a mistake.

613
30:29.640 --> 30:32.400
Isn't this "Bao Zhen Judging the Empress Dowager?"

614
30:32.400 --> 30:33.790
Wh-Who let them sing this?

615
30:33.790 --> 30:34.680
I don't know.

616
30:34.680 --> 30:35.680
What is this?

617
30:43.200 --> 30:44.550
♪ Godmother ♪

618
30:44.640 --> 30:46.070
♪ Zhonghua ♪

619
30:46.070 --> 30:47.350
♪ Godmother ♪

620
30:55.310 --> 31:02.680
♪ You are so kind and filial ♪

621
31:02.960 --> 31:09.920
♪ I can't bear to leave you behind ♪

622
31:10.880 --> 31:14.030
♪ All these years ♪

623
31:14.680 --> 31:18.480
♪ You've been running around for me ♪

624
31:18.550 --> 31:22.530
♪ Begging on the streets ♪

625
31:22.750 --> 31:26.200
♪ You've suffered a lot ♪

626
31:26.200 --> 31:29.960
♪ For me ♪

627
31:30.160 --> 31:33.000
♪ Without you ♪

628
31:33.240 --> 31:37.500
♪ I wouldn't still be alive ♪

629
31:37.680 --> 31:40.750
♪ Without you, I couldn't have ♪

630
31:40.750 --> 31:44.480
♪ Gotten my revenge ♪

631
32:22.740 --> 32:26.590
[Notice]

632
32:28.720 --> 32:30.110
Your baby has been born.

633
32:30.110 --> 32:31.370
Take a look at the baby.

634
32:31.480 --> 32:33.110
The baby was born

635
32:33.110 --> 32:34.240
at 10:08,

636
32:34.240 --> 32:35.750
weighing 3,200 grams.

637
32:35.880 --> 32:36.790
It's a boy.

638
32:36.790 --> 32:38.320
All indicators are normal.

639
32:38.480 --> 32:40.350
He'll go back to the ward with you later.

640
32:40.350 --> 32:41.480
You can hold him now.

641
33:18.030 --> 33:21.270
I wouldn't still be alive.

642
33:21.960 --> 33:25.000
Without you, I couldn't have

643
33:25.070 --> 33:29.270
gotten my revenge.

644
33:35.350 --> 33:36.080
Zhengliang?

645
33:36.440 --> 33:37.400
What's wrong, Zhengliang?

646
33:37.400 --> 33:38.930
Didn't they come together?

647
34:37.150 --> 34:40.790
[With Deepest Sympathy]

648
34:37.230 --> 34:41.510
Please bow to Ms. Li Zhongling

649
34:40.850 --> 34:46.610
[Ever-Present Voice and Countenance]

650
34:42.590 --> 34:43.840
three times.

651
34:46.880 --> 34:47.960
First bow.

652
34:55.190 --> 34:56.280
Second bow.

653
35:01.000 --> 35:02.070
Third bow.

654
35:08.030 --> 35:10.880
Please pay your respects to the deceased

655
35:11.190 --> 35:13.520
and offer your condolences to the family.

656
35:18.570 --> 35:21.820
[In Memoriam]

657
35:38.070 --> 35:39.000
My condolences.

658
35:41.880 --> 35:42.810
My condolences.

659
35:45.380 --> 35:48.500
♪ A soul that came to earth amid the cries ♪

660
35:48.920 --> 35:52.090
♪ Welcome to this city of haste ♪

661
35:52.560 --> 35:54.750
♪ Grow taller, quick as you can ♪

662
35:54.670 --> 35:55.320
My condolences.

663
35:55.160 --> 35:57.510
♪ Learn how to find your footing ♪

664
35:59.750 --> 36:03.020
♪ A soul who hid among the lanes and alleys ♪

665
36:03.500 --> 36:06.720
♪ A single turn, and the lamp at the door grows distant ♪

666
36:05.360 --> 36:08.070
Bid a final farewell to your mother.

667
36:07.160 --> 36:09.400
♪ The ticket bears no way back ♪

668
36:08.250 --> 36:12.430
[A Virtuous Mother for All Ages]

669
36:09.800 --> 36:12.180
♪ How like life it is ♪

670
36:12.760 --> 36:13.560
First kowtow.

671
36:14.350 --> 36:17.650
♪ One who nestled close on a winter's night ♪

672
36:18.010 --> 36:21.200
♪ A bite of food beside a pool of gaze ♪

673
36:21.760 --> 36:24.000
♪ When summer dusk arrives ♪

674
36:22.230 --> 36:24.630
Mother's soul returns to heaven.

675
36:24.420 --> 36:26.370
♪ We'll go to see the flowers ♪

676
36:25.190 --> 36:26.360
Second kowtow.

677
36:28.940 --> 36:32.170
♪ One who was stranded on the road ♪

678
36:31.320 --> 36:33.400
Bless the family with peace.

679
36:32.590 --> 36:35.720
♪ Heels buried under unseen snow ♪

680
36:33.960 --> 36:35.030
Third kowtow.

681
36:36.200 --> 36:38.440
♪ Don't panic—the journey is long ♪

682
36:37.920 --> 36:40.030
Pray for blessings upon the world.

683
36:38.810 --> 36:41.330
♪ Long enough to hold your pause ♪

684
36:43.840 --> 36:45.000
In this world,

685
36:45.840 --> 36:48.510
the kindness that can never be repaid

686
36:49.280 --> 36:51.800
is a mother's love and care.

687
36:55.190 --> 37:01.190
Mother is leaving today,

688
37:01.710 --> 37:07.590
and my heart truly aches.

689
37:09.110 --> 37:15.230
Tears fill my eyes.

690
37:16.620 --> 37:19.910
♪ You'll pass through the seasons, through dawn and dusk ♪

691
37:20.350 --> 37:23.500
♪ Hearing someone call your name, again and again ♪

692
37:23.950 --> 37:26.210
♪ These ties may hurt a little ♪

693
37:26.710 --> 37:28.910
♪ Don't heal a broken heart ♪

694
37:31.180 --> 37:34.290
♪ It will bear witness to the life you bravely lived ♪

695
37:34.900 --> 37:38.060
♪ To the beautiful souls you've loved ♪

696
37:38.560 --> 37:40.730
♪ To the address you call home ♪

697
37:41.240 --> 37:43.920
♪ In the little town you've wandered through ♪

698
37:46.410 --> 37:48.780
♪ The wind in the city ♪

699
37:49.160 --> 37:51.910
♪ Blows through dreams that flicker between light and dark ♪

700
37:52.980 --> 37:55.590
♪ Blows through one soul's radiance ♪

701
37:57.150 --> 37:59.360
♪ And all its weathered scars ♪

702
38:01.150 --> 38:03.300
♪ Blows through the depths of winter ♪

703
38:03.680 --> 38:06.480
♪ Stumbling along in the wind ♪

704
38:07.590 --> 38:10.160
♪ Flickering along in the wind ♪

705
38:11.740 --> 38:17.580
♪ Toward the crossroads brimming with sunlight ♪

706
38:21.260 --> 38:24.430
♪ May every road you take be safe ♪

707
38:24.640 --> 38:28.790
♪ May the scenery stay simple and carry you past regret ♪

708
38:29.250 --> 38:32.290
♪ Love deeply whatever comes to meet you ♪

709
38:32.820 --> 38:35.760
♪ And let those who leave be buried under snow on the hills ♪

710
38:36.530 --> 38:38.950
♪ May you come home covered in dust ♪

711
38:39.280 --> 38:43.160
♪ Held by what you love as you roam the world and return ♪

712
38:39.950 --> 38:45.240
[Xiaoximen Hospital, Helping You Live a Healthier Life]

713
38:44.310 --> 38:48.710
♪ Saying she was so beautiful in front of the door ♪

714
38:47.090 --> 38:53.170
[Funeral Wreaths and Burial Clothing]

715
38:47.150 --> 38:48.550
That lady was quite a decent person.

716
38:48.550 --> 38:49.510
Too decent.

717
38:49.550 --> 38:50.960
The pay is good, huh?

718
38:51.400 --> 38:52.550
What should we eat tonight?

719
38:52.550 --> 38:53.400
Barbecue.

720
38:57.150 --> 38:58.080
Eat more shrimp.

721
39:04.280 --> 39:05.120
Ch-Chen.

722
39:05.440 --> 39:06.040
What's up?

723
39:06.800 --> 39:08.200
Can I tell you something?

724
39:08.280 --> 39:09.070
Go ahead.

725
39:10.550 --> 39:11.440
This month,

726
39:11.550 --> 39:13.210
after I help you open the shop,

727
39:13.510 --> 39:14.400
I'll quit.

728
39:16.480 --> 39:18.740
What do you mean? What are you going to do?

729
39:21.150 --> 39:22.960
I'm thinking of going to Beijing to try my luck.

730
39:22.960 --> 39:24.360
You're going to Beijing?

731
39:32.800 --> 39:34.150
Do you know anyone in Beijing

732
39:34.150 --> 39:34.840
or what?

733
39:34.960 --> 39:36.490
Did someone offer you a job?

734
39:37.150 --> 39:39.480
Wh-Where are you going to live over there?

735
39:41.480 --> 39:42.840
I haven't thought about it yet.

736
39:42.840 --> 39:43.590
But it's fine.

737
39:43.590 --> 39:43.960
For this kind of thing,

738
39:43.960 --> 39:45.230
I'll just take it one step at a time.

739
39:45.230 --> 39:47.160
I won't starve to death in this era.

740
39:47.670 --> 39:48.440
It's mainly because I really can't

741
39:48.440 --> 39:50.100
keep staying at home anymore.

742
39:50.590 --> 39:51.360
Now whatever I see

743
39:51.360 --> 39:52.490
reminds me of my mom.

744
39:52.800 --> 39:53.800
It's too painful.

745
39:57.480 --> 39:59.540
Did you discuss it with your brother?

746
40:01.030 --> 40:02.760
What's there to discuss with him?

747
40:02.760 --> 40:03.550
You two are brothers.

748
40:03.550 --> 40:05.480
Shouldn't you discuss it with him?

749
40:07.150 --> 40:08.070
Isn't he the closest person

750
40:08.070 --> 40:09.530
you have in this world now?

751
40:09.630 --> 40:10.710
He's been in a big city

752
40:10.710 --> 40:12.400
for so many years. He has experience.

753
40:12.400 --> 40:13.930
Chen, let me put it this way.

754
40:14.230 --> 40:15.840
He's just a family member of mine

755
40:15.840 --> 40:17.800
who happens to share some blood with me.

756
40:17.800 --> 40:19.030
We're not close at all.

757
40:19.030 --> 40:20.630
Why are you acting like this?

758
40:21.400 --> 40:22.730
Are you still mad at him?

759
40:25.880 --> 40:27.590
Didn't he attend the funeral?

760
40:28.360 --> 40:29.960
Chen, the goods are here.

761
40:29.960 --> 40:30.480
Okay, okay.

762
40:30.480 --> 40:31.080
I'll do it.

763
40:31.630 --> 40:32.890
Give them to me, buddy.

764
40:35.800 --> 40:36.840
You can just leave the rest here.

765
40:36.840 --> 40:37.110
Alright.

766
40:37.110 --> 40:37.570
Thanks.

767
40:39.190 --> 40:41.030
Your expectations of him are too low.

768
40:41.030 --> 40:42.290
I'm warning you, Chen.

769
40:42.440 --> 40:43.150
Don't let his

770
40:43.150 --> 40:44.360
halo of an excellent surgeon

771
40:44.360 --> 40:45.230
deceive you.

772
40:45.510 --> 40:46.400
This guy

773
40:46.400 --> 40:47.360
is heartless and ungrateful,

774
40:47.360 --> 40:48.110
and definitely not a good match.

775
40:48.110 --> 40:50.230
Well, you also admit he's excellent,

776
40:50.230 --> 40:50.880
right?

777
40:51.150 --> 40:53.280
What's the use of him being excellent?

778
40:53.590 --> 40:55.250
It's all for outsiders to see.

779
40:55.590 --> 40:58.110
Anyone in his family is bound to have bad luck.

780
40:58.110 --> 40:59.360
Since he came back,

781
40:59.360 --> 41:01.090
he hasn't cared about me at all.

782
41:04.840 --> 41:06.900
Maybe you just don't know that he has.

783
41:10.440 --> 41:12.000
Chen, the goods are all here.

784
41:12.000 --> 41:12.670
Thanks, buddy.

785
41:12.670 --> 41:13.150
Okay.

786
41:13.150 --> 41:13.880
Just pile them here.

787
41:13.880 --> 41:14.880
Alright. I'm leaving, Chen.

788
41:14.880 --> 41:15.360
Bye.

789
41:15.440 --> 41:15.960
Bye.

790
41:22.070 --> 41:22.760
Dr. Liu!

791
41:23.360 --> 41:24.070
Dr. Liu!

792
41:25.000 --> 41:25.760
There's a patient in the ER

793
41:25.760 --> 41:27.090
with an open head injury

794
41:27.230 --> 41:28.430
that we can't handle!

795
41:29.760 --> 41:30.550
Coming.

796
41:54.250 --> 41:58.930
[Entrance] [Stroke Fast Track]

797
41:59.520 --> 42:01.800
[No Entry]

798
42:04.230 --> 42:05.030
Dr. Liu.

799
42:05.150 --> 42:06.030
Blood pressure 150 over 90.

800
42:06.030 --> 42:06.890
Heart rate 110.

801
42:08.760 --> 42:09.280
Ma'am.

802
42:10.070 --> 42:10.880
Ma'am.

803
42:14.710 --> 42:16.110
Do you know where you are?

804
42:16.800 --> 42:17.960
I don't know.

805
42:19.760 --> 42:20.890
How did you get hurt?

806
42:22.440 --> 42:24.280
Hit by a bat.

807
42:24.590 --> 42:26.120
I heard her husband hit her.

808
42:27.760 --> 42:28.760
The CT scan is out.

809
42:29.000 --> 42:30.200
Let me see the wounds.

810
42:36.480 --> 42:37.840
Is Director Tong in the hospital today?

811
42:37.840 --> 42:39.960
No, he went to the provincial capital for a meeting.

812
42:39.960 --> 42:40.760
Prepare an operating room.

813
42:40.760 --> 42:42.320
Yang Ran, you'll be my first assistant.

814
42:42.320 --> 42:42.960
Who? Me?

815
42:43.710 --> 42:44.880
I don't have any...

816
42:44.880 --> 42:46.880
experience handling this kind of situation.

817
42:46.880 --> 42:49.140
I'll schedule an operating room for you.

818
42:51.960 --> 42:52.510
You do it.

819
42:54.280 --> 42:55.000
I can't.

820
42:56.110 --> 42:58.710
I haven't been in an operating room for 2 years.

821
43:04.230 --> 43:05.360
Call Che Mingming.

822
43:06.150 --> 43:07.070
Tell her to come over immediately.

823
43:07.070 --> 43:08.070
MkvDrama.net
